The game begins.
I play with Timo.
Lena and Max stand on the other side.
Max hits the shuttlecock high.
I run back quickly.
I hit the shuttlecock hard and accurately.
It flies very quickly over the net.
Lena cannot hit the shuttlecock.
Timo and I have a point!
Timo looks at me in surprise.
"Wow, you can really play well!" Timo calls out.
I laugh and nod.
I just really like to play.
The game is very fast.
We run a lot across the court.
Max wants to play the shuttlecock into the corner.
But Timo jumps and hits the shuttlecock.
We laugh a lot together.
Timo and I are a good team.
